title: "Verified Negatives and False Alarms in Fire and Smoke Detection: A Cost-Sensitive Re-Evaluation on the D-Fire Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Analysis notebook that reproduces every computed table and figure of the paper from the
  frozen D-Fire split manifests and the stored detections of eight trained detectors, and
  code to retrain the YOLO11n and ResNet18+FPN+FCOS detectors.
